      "$value": "{color.clay.500}",
      "$description": "Intentional 3.0:1 pair (clay-500 on gray-50), mirroring claude.ai's own primary button; fine for graphical/large-text use. Text-heavy contexts should use clay-600 instead, as --sidebar-primary already does."
